==Troubleshooting==
A number of popular userscripts for MusicBrainz no longer work on Firefox 57+ and Greasemonkey 4+. See [[Greasemonkey#GreaseMonkey 4 incompatibility]]. Use [[Violentmonkey]] or [[Tampermonkey]] on Firefox instead.